appgrid (1.0.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * One-row header: logo, search, compact Browse by Category pill, nav.
  * Centered category chip strip when Browse is open; Clear filter last.
  * Initial Qt 6 rewrite with APT and optional Flatpak.
  * Target Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, Debian 12, and derivatives (Mint 22,
    elementary OS 8, Pop!_OS 24.04). Uses distro PyQt6, not PySide6.

